    <description><![CDATA[<div class="featured-image">
                <img src="/img/posts/45-reply-all-cover.webp" referrerpolicy="no-referrer">
            </div><p>The first one arrived on a Tuesday. Subject line: <em>Re: Sunday long run — bring the gazebo poles.</em></p>
<p>I don&rsquo;t run. I have never in my life owned a gazebo. I marked it as spam and forgot about it.</p>
<p>Four more came that week. Then a photograph: nine people in reflective vests standing in a car park under a sky the colour of wet cement, and underneath it, one line.</p>]]></description>
